  "body": "Three more Gen-4 organ behaviors wired *functionally* into `Mantle_Spreadsheet_Agent.html`, each **browser-verified** via the preview harness with the demo's own Stage-1 self-audit kept PASS:\n\n- **Graded memory** \u2014 `Cube.deweight()` + a weight overlay in `read()` (drop DEWEIGHT bookkeeping, hide ghosts, order by weight; a **no-op** when a band has no deweight activity, so existing reads are unchanged). Body primitives `memory.deweight` / `memory.ghosts`. `append()` now assigns band-unique ids so deweights can target them. *Verified: live stream = new value, ghost read = old value, original never mutated.*\n- **Self / Other** \u2014 the genesis key (`mintGenesisKey` + FNV keyed MAC) minted into the Body, **never in a cube band and never in the MIND's prompt**. Body primitives `self.sign` / `self.is_self` / `self.fingerprint`. *Verified: unique key per body, SELF verifies, forged + cloned macs are OTHER (anti-clone), key absent from the prompt.*\n- **Nociception** \u2014 `heart.pain` (the *now* interrupt, companion to `heart.schedule`'s *later*) dispatches a SIGNIFICANT `distress` sense carrying `{reason, band, ref}`. *Verified: pain wakes attention with the stressor coords.*\n\n`ORGAN_ATLAS` Heart/Genome/Immune/Memory updated. All four organ features (with part 1's `schedule_pulse`) pass together; self-audit PASS; zero console errors; `node --check` clean.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
